From: DerpFest <derpfest@local>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] SystemUI: fix looping haptics on QTI vibrator (sm8550)

On Xiaomi fuxi and similar QTI HAL devices, chained LOW_TICK primitives with
FLAG_PIPELINED_EFFECT cause continuous vibration while UI elements are held.
Replace primitive compositions with short one-shot pulses and cancel on release.

Affected: volume/brightness sliders, QS long-press, QS tiles, notification swipe.

Co-authored-by: DerpFest fuxi maintainers
---
--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/haptics/FuxiHapticEffects.kt	2026-07-07 11:40:40.107562662 +0300
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/haptics/FuxiHapticEffects.kt
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
